"This tool makes use of CTHelp by Stewart Lynch\nhttps://github.com/StewartLynch/CTHelp/blob/master/LICENSE\n3D model credits available at https://fenyo.net/network3dwifitools/credits.html\nEven if I often publish free software open-source code (see https://github.com/AlexandreFenyo), this specific software is not free, however it is open-source, but you must not redistribute the sources." = "To orodje uporablja CTHelp avtorja Stewarta Lyncha\nhttps://github.com/StewartLynch/CTHelp/blob/master/LICENSE\nZasluge za 3D modele so na voljo na https://fenyo.net/network3dwifitools/credits.html\nČeprav pogosto objavljam prosto programsko opremo odprte kode (glejte https://github.com/AlexandreFenyo), ta programska oprema ni prosta; njena koda je sicer odprta, vendar je ne smete razširjati.";
"Come back here after having started a TCP Flood Chargen action on a target (download speed testing).\nThe target must remain the same until the heat map is built.\n- to estimate the Wi-Fi internal throughput between local hosts, either select a target on the local wired network, or select a wirelessly connected target that is as close as possible to an access point, for instance using another iOS device running this app;\n- to estimate the Internet throughput for various locations on your local Wi-Fi network, select a target on the Internet, like flood.eowyn.eu.org." = "Sem se vrnite, ko na cilju zaženete dejanje TCP Flood Chargen (test hitrosti prenosa).\nCilj mora ostati isti, dokler toplotna karta ni izdelana.\n- za oceno notranje prepustnosti Wi-Fi med lokalnimi gostitelji izberite cilj v lokalnem žičnem omrežju ali brezžično povezan cilj, ki je čim bližje dostopni točki, na primer drugo napravo iOS, na kateri teče ta aplikacija;\n- za oceno internetne prepustnosti na različnih mestih vašega lokalnega omrežja Wi-Fi izberite cilj v internetu, na primer flood.eowyn.eu.org.";
"Welcome on the main page of this app. Either pull down the node list or click on the reload button, to scan the local network for new nodes. You can also select a node to display its IP addresses, then launch actions on the selected target. For instance, to estimate the average incoming and outgoing speed of your Internet connection, select the target flood.eowyn.eu.org that is a host on the Internet that supports both TCP Chargen and Discard services. Then launch one of the following action: TCP flood discard to estimate outgoing speed to the Internet, or TCP flood chargen to estimate incoming speed from the Internet." = "Dobrodošli na glavni strani te aplikacije. Povlecite seznam vozlišč navzdol ali kliknite gumb za ponovno nalaganje, da v lokalnem omrežju poiščete nova vozlišča. Izberete lahko tudi vozlišče, da prikažete njegove naslove IP, nato pa na izbranem cilju zaženete dejanja. Če želite na primer oceniti povprečno dohodno in odhodno hitrost internetne povezave, izberite cilj flood.eowyn.eu.org, gostitelja v internetu, ki podpira storitvi TCP Chargen in Discard. Nato zaženite eno od naslednjih dejanj: TCP flood discard za oceno odhodne hitrosti v internet ali TCP flood chargen za oceno dohodne hitrosti iz interneta.";
