"The advanced interface provides access to every network tools (discovery of devices on the local network, latency and throughput measurements, scanning of open ports and services, 3D view of the network, ...).\n\nIt also allows building a WiFi coverage heatmap, with many options. This interface is intended for users who already have some initial knowledge of networks." = "Napredni vmesnik omogoča dostop do vseh omrežnih orodij (odkrivanje naprav v lokalnem omrežju, merjenje zakasnitve in prepustnosti, iskanje odprtih vrat in storitev, 3D pogled omrežja ...).\n\nOmogoča tudi izdelavo toplotne karte pokritosti Wi-Fi s številnimi možnostmi. Ta vmesnik je namenjen uporabnikom, ki že imajo nekaj osnovnega znanja o omrežjih.";
"The step-by-step interface is dedicated to building a WiFi coverage heatmap, it is specifically aimed at users wishing to create a WiFi coverage heatmap as simply as possible, with complete support.\n\nNo prior knowledge of networks is necessary." = "Vmesnik po korakih je namenjen izdelavi toplotne karte pokritosti Wi-Fi, posebej za uporabnike, ki želijo takšno karto izdelati čim preprosteje in s popolnim vodenjem.\n\nPredhodno znanje o omrežjih ni potrebno.";
"The documentation describes the steps to build a WiFi coverage heatmap with the advanced interface, using for example two iPhone/iPad to establish local measurements, or using a single iPhone/iPad and the CHARGEN (traffic generation protocol) responder deployed on the Internet and dedicated to this application.\n\nTo discover the other tools provided by this application (discovery of devices on the local network, latency and throughput measurements, scanning of open ports and services, 3D view of the network, ...) launch the advanced interface and click on the help button at the top left of the screen." = "Dokumentacija opisuje korake za izdelavo toplotne karte pokritosti Wi-Fi z naprednim vmesnikom, na primer z dvema napravama iPhone/iPad za lokalne meritve ali z eno napravo iPhone/iPad in odzivnikom CHARGEN (protokol za ustvarjanje prometa), nameščenim v internetu in namenjenim tej aplikaciji.\n\nČe želite spoznati druga orodja te aplikacije (odkrivanje naprav v lokalnem omrežju, merjenje zakasnitve in prepustnosti, iskanje odprtih vrat in storitev, 3D pogled omrežja ...), zaženite napredni vmesnik in kliknite gumb za pomoč v zgornjem levem kotu zaslona.";
"Click on your prefered blinking rectangle to choose between advanced interface, step-by-step heatmap and documentation. Click on the question marks to get help about each interface." = "Kliknite želeni utripajoči pravokotnik, da izberete napredni vmesnik, toplotno karto po korakih ali dokumentacijo. Kliknite vprašaje za pomoč o posameznem vmesniku.";
