/* Phrases à trou (%@ = adresse ou nom) */
"Parallel TCP connections will be established to %@ on TCP ports from 1 to 65535, to find open services. The new discovered services will be displayed on the bottom view. You can interrupt this task by pressing the STOP button." = "Z gostiteljem %@ bodo vzpostavljene vzporedne povezave TCP na vratih TCP od 1 do 65535, da se najdejo odprte storitve. Novo odkrite storitve bodo prikazane v spodnjem pogledu. To opravilo lahko prekinete s pritiskom na gumb STOP.";
"A TCP connection to the Discard port (9/TCP) of %@ will be established. Data will then be sent on this connection at the maximum throughput available, by this device to this target host, to evaluate the maximum speed that can be reached in the outgoing direction. You can interrupt this task by pressing the STOP button." = "Vzpostavljena bo povezava TCP z vrati Discard (9/TCP) gostitelja %@. Ta naprava bo nato po tej povezavi pošiljala podatke ciljnemu gostitelju z največjo razpoložljivo prepustnostjo, da se oceni največja hitrost, ki jo je mogoče doseči v odhodni smeri. To opravilo lahko prekinete s pritiskom na gumb STOP.";
"A TCP connection to the Chargen port (19/TCP) of %@ will be established. Data will then be received on this connection at the maximum throughput available, by this device from this target host, to evaluate the maximum speed that can be reached in the incoming direction. You can interrupt this task by pressing the STOP button." = "Vzpostavljena bo povezava TCP z vrati Chargen (19/TCP) gostitelja %@. Ta naprava bo nato po tej povezavi prejemala podatke od ciljnega gostitelja z največjo razpoložljivo prepustnostjo, da se oceni največja hitrost, ki jo je mogoče doseči v dohodni smeri. To opravilo lahko prekinete s pritiskom na gumb STOP.";
"ICMP packets of type ECHO_REQUEST will be sent to %@ at a rate of one packet per second. The target should reply with an ICMP packet of type ECHO_REPLY. The round trip type is computed and displayed on the chart. You can interrupt this task by pressing the STOP button." = "Paketi ICMP vrste ECHO_REQUEST bodo pošiljani gostitelju %@ s hitrostjo enega paketa na sekundo. Cilj naj odgovori s paketom ICMP vrste ECHO_REPLY. Čas povratne poti se izračuna in prikaže na grafu. To opravilo lahko prekinete s pritiskom na gumb STOP.";
"found %@" = "najden gostitelj %@";
"trying %@" = "preizkušam gostitelja %@";
"retrying %@" = "ponovno preizkušam gostitelja %@";
